== r3.99 (A4): `Use M.(X)` takes only X unqualified; the rest of M's
== public names stay reachable qualified.
Use Bank.Accounts.(Fee)

Main :
    PutLn(Fee(10), " ", Bank.Accounts.MaxDeposit)
;
